<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex, Tibetan-first proposal; no human semantic approval. The second cha shas gsum is resumed as they; its lexical correspondence is distributed and omitted, not null. The temporal ma before zhig is fused into until ... ends, distinct from the matrix ma linked to not. tsam and de/de'i resumptions are omitted where English expands or redistributes them. The single byas pa owns the second provides, next to contributing factor; the first provides is an English restatement of the shared causal predication. Material cause, contributing factor, continuation and blood and pus follow the source and HGM lexical evidence.</div>
